{"id":"wb-6-267","name":"李诫墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李诫墓","text":"李诫墓位于河南省新郑市龙湖镇于寨村西。全国重点文物保护单位。\n李诫，字明仲，郑州管城县（今河南省新郑市）人，北宋著名建筑师，著有《营造法式》。大观四年（1110年）二月，李诫逝世，葬在家乡郑州管城县新郑梅山。\n2006年管城县新郑梅山李诫墓被列为全国重点文物保护单位。2008年8月上旬，中国文物界、建筑界多名专家在河南省新郑市，为李诫墓园整修工程举行奠基仪式，以纪念李诫及所著《营造法式》颁行900周年。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E8%AF%AB%E5%A2%93","revisionId":85339403,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85339403","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb38c6d1255e6ca249e53c3f.jpg","title":"20210323_Tomb_of_Li_Jie_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20210323_Tomb_of_Li_Jie_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/20210323_Tomb_of_Li_Jie_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Tomb of Li Jie","width":320,"height":213}}